Summary (not part of the license)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Whyfull's source is public so you can see exactly what it does. You may read
it, audit it, point to it in bug reports and send contributions. You may not
copy, modify, redistribute or reuse it. This is not an open source license and
it will not turn into one. Running Whyfull is covered by the End User License
Agreement in EULA.md, not by this file.

